      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It should also absolutely be easily adjustable for getting different kinds of shots during a video shoot. Some real drone controllers have switches for changing input profiles affecting both rotation & position, often a very smooth, normal, and very fast option.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
