  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-09-14T02:36:53.109Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The drone controls tend to be very sensitive using thumbsticks. This makes it quite difficult to precisely place the drone camera. It might be good to consider, for example, using grab-and-move controls instead of thumbstick controls (like the VirtualLens drone system uses), as this allows the control movements to be made over a larger physical space, allowing more precision.",
